    "methods_description": "EEG was recorded using a Brain Vision active ACTICHAMP system with 64 electrodes, without a shielded room, with participants seated 85 cm from a monitor; responses were collected via a CedrusBox RB-530. Data were provided in long epochs (5.04 s, from -1.87 s to 3.17 s relative to target onset), high-pass (0.10 Hz) and low-pass (45 Hz) filtered offline using a 4th order IIR Butterworth filter, re-referenced to the average of the two mastoids (TP9, TP10), and cleaned of eye-related activity using ICA decomposition.",
